      "message": "As part of \nframeworks/base/media/java/android/media/AudioPresentation.java\n\nAudioPresentation class is declared as final\npublic final class AudioPresentation\n\nIn Java the purpose of using a class being declared as final is to prevent the class from being subclassed. If a class is marked as final then no class can inherit any feature from the final class.\n\nSo basically we cannot subclass AudioPresentation class.",
